&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in any/all of the following programming languages: Typescript, Python, Go, Terraform, Bash&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and operating software in an AWS cloud environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with relational database concepts and operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of full-time job experience in a software engineering role with a platform engineering focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
