&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with internal developer platform frameworks such as Backstage, OpsLevel, Cortex, or Battlestar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Terraform and Kubernetes and general fluency with infrastructure-as-code concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with AI platforms such as Claude, ChatGPT, and/or Copilot to accelerate software development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SaaS and open source observability tools, such as OpenTelemetry, Datadog, Grafana, and Prometheus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
