&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is needed to lead the development of innovative backend within our Catalog Platform team. As a Software Engineer, you will play a crucial role in expanding and enhancing our product catalog capabilities, ensuring seamless sales operations and minimal business friction. You will also tackle complex pricing configurations for over 305,000 active customers and handle the processing of more than 1 billion price transactions daily.&lt;/p&gt;
