&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of API development frameworks, system architecture, and backend development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with distributed cloud services, microservices architecture, and cloud infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of database management and data-driven application development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving skills and ability to work under tight deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and experience interacting with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
